{"sourceUrl":"https://sfs.cumt.edu.cn/9e/0c/c1016a695820/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:11.184041+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sfs.cumt.edu.cn/9e/0c/c1016a695820/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>根据《关于做好</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）工作的通知》《中国矿业大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生复试录取工作公告》文件精神，为进一步推动我院科学规范选拔、择优录取，保障考生权利，维护公平竞争环境，结合我院实际情况，外国语言文化学院特制定</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生复试录取工作细则。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>一、总体要求</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>学院将严格审查所有考生是否符合学校公布的接收基本条件，全面衡量考生的德、智、体表现，严格标准，宁缺勿滥，确保我院接收推免生工作公开、公正、公平。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>二、复试组织及要求</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1. 2027</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生录取工作领导小组指导复试工作，负责确定并向研究生院报送拟录取学生名单。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>复试专家小组负责复试的具体工作，及时审核报名考生申请材料，根据学生情况及时遴选，分批组织线下复试工作。复试工作本着先申请先审核的原则，择优选拔，额满为止。学院根据招生计划、复试成绩等择优确定待录取名单。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://sfs.cumt.edu.cn/9e/0c/c1016a695820/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>3</span></span></a><span><span><span>．报到时间：第一批</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>8:00-10:30</span></span></span><span><span><span>；第二批报到时间待定</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>．报到地点：南湖校区文科楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>B102</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>．复试时间：第一批</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>13:00</span></span></span><span><span><span>起；第二批复试时间待定</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>．复试地点：文科楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>B</span></span></span><span><span><span>区三层</span></span></span><span></span><span><span><span>候场场地</span></span></span><span><span><span>B102</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7 . </span></span></span><span><span><span>复试抽签时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span><span><span><span>11：45</span></span></span><span><span><span>；第二批待定</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>8. </span></span></span><span><span><span>复试抽签地点：文科楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>B102</span></span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>三、拟接收推荐免试硕士研究生计划</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>接收专业：（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）学术型：外国语言文学；（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）专业型：英语笔译。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>拟接收推免计划：以《中国矿业大学</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年硕士研究生招生专业目录》公布的拟招生人数和拟招推免生人数为参考，具体以实际接收情况为准。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>四、申请条件</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>申请攻读我院硕士学位的推荐免试生，应具备如下条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>．拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱英语学习，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>．申请人须获得本科所在学校当年（</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年）推荐免试资格，并在教育部中国研究生招生信息网“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“教育部推免服务系统”）中获得本科所在院校推荐免试资格名单备案。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．诚实守信、品行端正、学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>．申请人在大学本科阶段学习成绩优秀，在学期间所学专业主干课程无补考记录。有较好的科研潜力，具有较强的调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>．外国语程度优秀，具有较强的外国语听、说、读、写、译等应用能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>．身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>五、网上报名及要求</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>．预报名。获得推免资格且有意报考我校的推免生，请于</span></span><span><span>9 </span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span> 18 </span></span><span><span>日前通过“中国矿业大学研究生预推免招生系统”（网址：</span></span><span><span>https://yzs.cumt.edu.cn/yzbm/logon</span></span><span><span>）进行预报名（招生专业以系统中的招生专业为参考，最终以学校发布的招生专业目录为准）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>．正式报名。根据要求，获得推免资格的考生可登录中国研究生招生信息网的“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（网址：</span></span><span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span><span><span>，简称“推免服务系统”）按相关要求进行信息注册、上传照片、网上缴费、填报志愿。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．提交材料。取得复试资格的推免生，按外文学院复试安排参加复试，复试前需提供以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）本人有效居民身份证、学生证复印件（展示原件</span></span><span><span>留复印件</span></span><span><span>学生证需注册）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）中国矿业大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表（预推免报名系统可生成）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）中国矿业大学接收推荐免试硕士研究生复试登记表（预推免报名系统可生成）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）本科学习成绩单及排名证明扫描件（须加盖学校成绩管理部门公章。公章原件现场展示，复印件留存</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）思想政治考察表（由系统直接导出，签字盖所在单位党委红章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>）外语水平证明（如</span></span><span><span>CET-4</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>CET-6</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>TOEFL</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>IELTS</span></span><span><span>等），请提供证书或成绩单扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>）学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的成果）扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>）诚信承诺书（预推免报名系统可下载）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>考生可提供在校期间所获省级及以上获奖证书或发表在正式刊物上的文章（封皮、封底、目录、文章正文）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>考生可提供个人简历（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>份）、专家推荐信等补充材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>上述申请材料在考生来我院报到时，根据自身实际情况将相应纸质材料交至报到处（南湖校区文科楼</span></span><span><span>B102</span></span><span><span>）并当场审核。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>六、复试方法与内容</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>．复试资格：参加复试考生应为获得推免资格、有意愿报考我校并已在我校</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免预报名系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>内填报过报名信息的学生或教育部</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>开放后，教育部</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>内的其他报名考生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>．组织方式：线下面试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>．复试内容：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）第一批考试安排。</span></span></p><p><span><span>考试形式：面试</span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span>面试时间：</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>19</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>00</span></span><span><span>起</span></span></p><p><span><span>面试地点：文科楼</span></span><span><span>B</span></span><span><span>区三层</span></span></p><p><span><span>面试内容：①思想政治素质和品德考核，包括考查考生的政治态度、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等内容，该部分考核不计入总分，但作为面试重要参考，不合格者不予拟录取；②英语自我介绍；③英语口头作文或口译；④针对学生外国语言文学或翻译的相关基础知识、思辨能力、学术潜力、综合素养等方面考核提问。</span></span></p><p><span><span>面试顺序：随机抽签</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）第二批考试安排：以学院通知为准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>复试满分为</span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span>分。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>七、录取方法</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拟录取名单确定后，学校将通过教育部“推免服务系统”发送拟录取通知，推免生接到拟录取通知后在学院规定的时间内应予以拟录取确认，逾期未确认者，学校有权取消该生的拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>推免生在申请时必须保证所提供申请材料的真实性和准确性，一旦发现申请人提交的材料不真实不准确，我校将不予录取或取消资格。复试成绩不及格者不予录取，思想政治考察不合格者不予录取，不参加体检或体检不合格者不予录取，弄虚作假者不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>同等条件下，优先考虑获“挑战杯”“创青春”“互联网</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>”科技竞赛省级最高奖及以上，团队成员本科生中国家级特等奖前</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>名、一等奖第</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>名的学生；或以独立作者或第一作者在</span></span><span><span>SCI</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>SSCI</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>A&amp;HCI</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>EI</span></span><span><span>收录期刊、</span></span><span><span>CSSCI</span></span><span><span>收录期刊、</span></span><span><span>CSCD</span></span><span><span>来源期刊、北大中文核心期刊发表与学业相关论文（会议论文及增刊除外）的学生；或持有</span></span><span><span>CATTI</span></span><span><span>二级及以上证书的学生。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span>八、其他与联系方式</span></strong></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>外国语言文学方向考生录取入校后，根据</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>分数优先，遵循志愿</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的原则，由学院统筹安排，全体外国语言文学方向考生选择二级学科方向。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span>未作说明事项遵照中国矿业大学相关文件执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系方式：</span></span><span><span>0516-83591602</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：林</span></span><span><span>妍</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>         </span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>               </span></span></strong></span><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span><span>外国语言文化学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                  </span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><strong></strong></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"7bac36e80a2bfa4f3d83c03c5d067c90c5d49730b3f576245839c7e397099dd9","textLength":2666,"sourceSha256":"ca2c80d4dddfaa37a09612d100aaae2b7a9079647a0a5ca86cba9f0106960933","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b4cca0fa00ae620b4adb","title":"2026年中国矿业大学外国语言文化学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生复试录取工作细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:11.184041+00:00"}
